{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ff0bd55437702c2bc8e4df1ab33bbc128fbe44339ca2d1bb213e83aabd3daf6", "ja": "（今日は、ドラマのポスターの撮影だ。このみさんは\n『元不良の熱血教師』という役どころだけど……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄电视剧海报。木实饰演的是“前不良少女的热血教师”，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "46ed3f5c9ce2bec3dff8201fa9c1f66e8bc96aa68fe2ed21243d03059cb7cb15", "ja": "ウフフフ……どうかしら？\n{$P$}。私の教師役。", "zh": "呵呵呵……怎么样？\n{$P$}，我演老师像不像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "e596c786abef92a441261bc37fff9425262edfe8f928903d690867fd3dba4cfd", "ja": "この、背負ったものの大きさにかけて！\n教え子達は必ず、守ってみせる！　……なーんてね♪", "zh": "就凭我肩负之物的分量！\n我一定会保护好自己的学生们！……开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5cfc2e2aed1ef77d6e6c8d2c0673c37b606d996fd5d82d16328da0661bba613a", "ja": "なんというか……貫禄がありますね！", "zh": "不知该怎么说……真是很有气势呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "c8ab426998def47d7ecfa9f3cc4425c8e0dc53d27038ff3e41dfac158e9b4e69", "ja": "貫録……それってつまり、アダルティって事よね？\nウフフ、教師役、やれてよかったわ♪", "zh": "气派……也就是说，成熟妩媚的意思吧？\n呵呵，能演老师真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a35d6fbd8dc6922f4ef204f3c0df3c557818fcafd9ac1c4079363d5eccc78b26", "ja": "ええ、ハマり役でしたね。\n何か特別にレッスンしたりしたんですか？", "zh": "是啊，简直是本色出演呢。\n你是不是特意练习过什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "18d19979763d8144892f8098afca86e47b04b262e8c56384519c39f119bf0641", "ja": "レッスンっていうか、劇場の若い子と接していると、\n本当に先生みたいな事をしちゃうのよね。", "zh": "与其说是训练，不如说是和剧场里的年轻孩子们相处时，真的会不知不觉做起老师做的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "80fd75030df43f05e0fb3d373f554fcbd15ad9f50e317869a9d561c0040a3351", "ja": "進路相談を聞いたり、私の就職とか、\n社会人時代の経験を話したり。そのおかげかしらね。", "zh": "听别人咨询未来的规划，聊聊我找工作和当社会人的经历之类的。也许就是因为这些吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2af2407f65467a1d3f08579eb089a2dbb339ad39509ad8b3d1317b46437afafe", "ja": "そうだったんですか？　ありがとうございます、\nみんなの力になってくれて。", "zh": "原来是这样吗？谢谢你为大家提供帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "0563eb7fcbcda79e520ac2a43e40ddfa58e8d22b491d0eff855ea9fedca871e5", "ja": "先に生まれるって書いて、先生だもの。\n年長者として、できることはしてあげないとね。", "zh": "因为写作“先出生”，所以才叫“先生”嘛。\n作为年长者，能做到的事情还是得帮大家做才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "b4794432a6a2bf5e791b859b505e67132565556a6bb3975d968fd63e78c720e5", "ja": "あ、だけど{$P$}も普段から、\n765プロのみんなの先生役をやってる感じじゃない？", "zh": "啊，不过，{$P$}平时不也有种在给765事务所的大家当老师的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "600c7c10a6e89e2269f8e7637a35f35e94eecd5078a801dcdf57f82b0504713e", "ja": "そうですかね？　あまり自覚はないですが。\n別に、うまい指導者ってわけでもないですし……。", "zh": "是这样吗？我没怎么意识到这一点。\n而且，我也算不上什么优秀的指导者……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "20dec3794b8f72ee3e574e585afca53e2b4d3330f12ae5128da95b871711f217", "ja": "ううん。私から見たら、なかなか親しみやすくて、\nいざとなれば頼りになる先生。そんな雰囲気よ。", "zh": "不是哦。在我看来，你挺有亲和力的，\n关键时刻也很靠得住。就是这种感觉的老师哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e51b34be9341675139be0557d9b90b640d4fd744291470b06df5d701f59d1fcf", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると光栄です。\nでも、みんなの進路か……悩ましいですよね。", "zh": "能听到您这么说，我很荣幸。\n不过，关于大家今后的道路……确实让人苦恼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "90ffe530326603078bf535e8cda16e0246e973b0a24e5ba49ff41b42e5708d14", "ja": "こればかりは、ひとつの正解ってないものね。\nみんなそれぞれ、いい方向に向かって欲しいけど……。", "zh": "这件事啊，确实不存在唯一的正确答案呢。\n虽然希望大家都能朝着好的方向前进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "94e51b4cd1151bb2b7487fc00bac6694d034557c856ff4598228abaa0e229ed4", "ja": "って、なんだか本当に、先生同士みたいな会話\nしちゃってるかしら、私達？　ふふっ。", "zh": "这么说来，我们好像真的聊得像老师之间的对话呢？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "c2d9663bfad66667f3a23ae4fb3e051e8bcd069554bddcf9de431e2e649cc717", "ja": "これからも大人同士、お互い気軽に\n相談していきましょうよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "今后我们也以大人的身份，彼此随意商量吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4da950948f00be0c583698eafd6af7cd9c38b53194c92a3377d75c22cad0d3e9", "ja": "そうですね。頼りにさせてもらいますよ。", "zh": "是啊。以后就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "a976fc0a953ce4c0c2e7ca35431d1a52dfc44b97a8e4fd82a146735077dbb04c", "ja": "なんなら、恋愛相談でもいいのよ？\nセクシーこのみ先生がバッチリ、解決してあげるから！", "zh": "要不然，来咨询恋爱问题也可以哦？\n性感的木实老师会帮你完美解决的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5baf927e429d7e0339202018af02611909a8c0bacd4f2dbcb96840d3f5a52ae1", "ja": "え、ええ、まあ機会があれば……。とりあえずは、\n今日の撮影をしっかりお願いします！", "zh": "呃、嗯，有机会的话……总之，今天的拍摄就拜托你认真完成了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0204_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "5deed7f11e2ec47bb26b5026ebed63409f780b249260a1d9d1e6dd24b9e2be88", "ja": "あら、ごまかさなくていいのに……またあとで\nゆっくり、話し合いましょう？　夜・露・死・苦。ね♪", "zh": "哎呀，不用遮遮掩掩的嘛……等会儿再\n好好谈谈吧？请・多・关・照・哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
